{"ticker":"GANECOS","symbol":"GANECOS","instrumentId":3028692,"name":"Ganesha Ecosphere","industry":"NSE-Apparel-Clothing Mfg","about":"Ganesha Ecosphere Ltd. is a pioneer in PET waste recycling in India, transforming discarded plastic bottles into recycled polyester staple fiber (RPSF) and spun yarn. The company operates state-of-the-art recycling facilities that process over 100,000 tons of PET waste annually, contributing significantly to environmental sustainability. Ganesha’s recycled fibers are used in various applications, including apparel, automotive interiors, home textiles, and non-woven fabrics. The company’s commitment to green manufacturing practices helps reduce plastic waste, conserve natural resources, and promote a circular economy. Ganesha Ecosphere is a trusted supplier of eco-friendly fibers, serving both domestic and international markets with quality and innovation.","website":"www.ganeshaecosphere.com","location":"Kanpur Dehat, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:21:29.492Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":880.5,"changePct":0.8648834412051039,"week52High":1237.95,"week52Low":669.85},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹2,359 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,718 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"16,345,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"65"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"7,298,410"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.40%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.85"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"27.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.06"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.64"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-2%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"27.68"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"15–83"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"3.0%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"63.7"},{"label":"Volume","value":"85,015"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"87,560"},{"label":"Master score","value":"60"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"51"},{"label":"Pric